    {
      "id": 1664,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "```http://edex.adobe.com/search/global/[SEARCH_HERE] ``` does not properly escape input and allows for reflected XSS.  \n\nThe search stops and strips on = to avoid XSS but does not handle encodings.\nUsing ```%3D``` for ```=``` it is possible to inject reflected XSS attacks.",
